Each Client shall pay the fees set out in {{attach: schedule-b, label=Schedule B}} within
{{duration: 30, unit=D}} of the date of the relevant invoice, for example
{{field: INV-2026-0042, type=invoice-id}}.

The minimum monthly commitment is {{money: 12500, currency=USD, note=Committed platform fee}} per
Client. Usage above the committed volume is charged at
{{money: 0.45, currency=USD, note=Per-unit overage rate}} per unit.

## Late Payment {#payment-late}

Undisputed sums not paid when due bear interest at
{{placeholder: late-payment-rate, type=text, note=Rate agreed per Client during onboarding}} per
annum, accruing daily from the due date until payment.

The Provider shall not suspend the {{term: services}} for late payment unless:

- the sum has been overdue for more than {{duration: 45, unit=D}} {#suspend-overdue}
- the Provider has given {{duration: 10, unit=D}} written notice of its intention to suspend {#suspend-notice}

Suspension under {{ref: suspend-overdue}} does not relieve the Client of its payment obligations.

## Invoicing Disputes {#payment-disputes}

A Client disputing an invoice in good faith shall notify the Provider within
{{duration: 15, unit=D}} of receipt and shall pay all undisputed amounts when due. The parties
shall escalate any unresolved dispute to their respective representatives within
{{duration: 5, unit=D}} of that notice.
